                "Well done, my friend. That's one giant who won't be getting up.",
                "Down came the colossus. I heard the thud from headquarters.",
                "One villain fewer with a doomsday device. The Ministry sleeps soundly tonight.",
                "Top secret, of course, but between us: that was magnificent.",
                "Rather a large villain to topple. You made it look civilised.",
                "Did the boss shout about world domination first? They always do.",
                "Twelve phases or three, it hardly matters. You won.",
                "News travels fast. The cipher room is already celebrating.",
                "Nerves of steel, the lot of you. A first kill to be proud of.",
                "Somebody fetch the brass band. Quietly. A raid boss has fallen.",
                "How many potions did that take? Never mind, it was worth it.",
                "Just as I predicted in the briefing. Well, roughly.",
                "Like a heist with dozens of accomplices and one magnificent vault.",
                "Hats off. That giant had been on my mind for months.",
                "Your raid has sent a clear message to every villain out there.",
                "What a night. I'll need a strong cup of tea just hearing about it.",
                "Mark the date. Your first kill on that tyrant goes in the annals.",
                "Perfectly timed, perfectly executed, perfectly dressed. Bravo.",
                "Ah, a raid boss. The villain's villain. Felled by you lot.",
                "Straight to the top of the leaderboard at headquarters.",
                "Many hands, one victory. That's how the Ministry likes it.",
                "Hold the front page. Discreetly. A tyrant has fallen.",
                "Mighty work. The ground is still shaking from that fall.",
                "Was that the final phase or the last straw? Both, I suspect.",
                "They told me that boss was the toughest in the realm. Not tonight.",
                "Bring out the bunting. The big villain is no more.",
                "In the end, the giant was no match for a good plan. Lovely.",
                "You'll be pleased to know the doomsday device has been unplugged.",
                "Grand villains deserve grand endings. You delivered one.",
                "Ever so impressive. I'll be bragging about your raid at dinner.",
                "Who needs gadgets when you have a raid like yours?",
                "Phase after phase, and you never lost your composure. Remarkable.",
                "Even the castle's gargoyles applauded, I'm told.",
                "All those wipes have finally paid off. Splendid persistence.",
                "Behold, the end of a tyranny. And a rather good loot table.",
                "At long last the boss falls. Pour the good stuff.",
                "Imagine the boss's face when the last blow landed. Priceless.",
                "Your raid deserves its own codename now. I'll think of one.",
                "Victory, my friend. The sweetest kind, shared by many.",
                "Quite a spectacle, I hear. Explosions, lasers and a very large fall.",
                "Not even a moat of lava could keep your raid out.",
                "Top marks for the whole raid. And an extra mark for you.",
                "Such a big villain, and such a tidy finish. Admirable.",
                "Truly a first kill to remember. I'm proud of you, agent.",
                "Now that the giant is down, do take a moment to breathe.",
                "One small step for you, one giant fall for the boss.",
                "History will remember tonight. Or at least I will.",
                "Your raid leader called it, and you all delivered. Brilliant.",
                "Ah, that blissful moment when the health bar empties. Congratulations.",
                "Every agent dreams of a kill like that. You lived it.",
                "Grand work. The villain's master plan never left the drawing board.",
                "It took a whole army, and you were its finest soldier.",
                "Remarkable resolve. I'd have given up and gone to the casino.",
                "That kill will echo through every secret corridor in the land.",
                "Raise your glasses, everyone. Tea, martinis, whatever's at hand.",
                "So much for the boss's unbreakable shield. Splendid.",
                "Fantastic news. The handler is ordering cake for the whole floor.",
                "Glorious. That boss made the mistake of underestimating you.",
                "Ten thousand minions couldn't save him. Your raid made sure.",
                "Hip hip, quietly. That was a first kill to treasure.",
                "Gentlemen and ladies of the raid, my compliments.",
                "Truly heroic. The bards will sing of it. The spies will whisper.",
                "After a fight like that, you've earned a week by the sea.",
                "Pity the villain who next tries to conquer the world. You're ready.",
                "You've put a very large dent in the villains' plans. Superb.",
                "A raid boss! Do sit down. Your legs must be shaking.",
                "Now there's a mission report I'll read twice.",
                "What splendid chaos it must have been. And what a finish.",
                "The villain built a fortress. Your raid built a legend.",
                "Precision and patience won the night. My hat goes off to you.",
                "It seems the mastermind wasn't so masterful after all.",
                "Few agents ever see a boss like that fall. You've made it happen.",
                "Every phase, every mechanic, every danger. Mastered.",
                "Sheer brilliance. I'll be telling this one for years.",
                "Hooray for the raid. Quietly, of course. We have a reputation.",
                "Tell me you got a screenshot of the boss falling. For the file.",
                "Simply marvellous. A villain of that size is a rare trophy.",
                "Big boss, bigger raid, biggest smile on my face.",
                "At last! That tyrant has troubled my dreams long enough.",
            },
